Before we jump into the code, I need to make one gentle correction: you mentioned setting the **Currency** length to min 5 max 5. In the financial world—and in your existing database schema—currency codes (like INR, USD, EUR) are strictly **3 characters**. Setting this to 5 would instantly break your validations and database inserts. I'm going to set it to strictly 3 characters (min = 3, max = 3) to keep your application functioning correctly.
